      "GUAM U.S. A. - PAN AM CHINA CLIPPER II\nCHINA C\nshown as she arrived on Guam in the late after-\nnoon of November 24, 1985, for the 50th anniver-\nsary of service across the Pacific. She duplicat-\ned the original route from San Francisco to Hon-\nolulu, Midway Island, Wake Island, and Guam be-\nfore landing in Manila.\n688A666\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\nR \u0026 J A Guam Production\n90"
